Our episodes deal with serious and often distressing incidents. If you feel at any time you need support, please contact your local crisis centre. For suggested phone numbers for confidential support, please see the show notes for this episode on your app or on our website. In late April 1972, a serious matter was unravelling at the West Friedhoff mortuary in Nuremberg, Germany. Several relatives of the recently deceased had noticed a jewellery missing from their loved one's bodies.
我们的节目涉及严重且往往令人痛苦的事件。如果您在任何时候感到需要支持，请联系您当地的危机中心。有关机密支持的建议电话号码，请查看您使用的应用程序上或我们网站上的本集节目说明。1972年4月下旬，德国纽伦堡的西弗里德霍夫（West Friedhoff）停尸房发生了一起严重的案件。几位近期逝者的亲属发现，死者遗体上的珠宝不翼而飞。

2
