箱子里妥善保管。这些东西重新出现只是时间问题。然而这一次，格奥尔格开始怀疑有些不对劲。一天，当格奥尔格走进停尸房的休息室时，发现桌上的一个钱箱被移位了。它被强行撬开并洗劫一空。由于没有入室盗窃的迹象，格奥尔格认为罪魁祸首很可能是停尸房或毗邻的纽伦堡西公墓的工作人员。

4
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:32.000
To avoid causing tension amongst his colleagues or tarnishing the reputation of his workplace, Georg kept his suspicions to himself. He began investigating the matter discreetly, with the intention to confront the perpetrator once he had identified them. A six-foot-tall, burly war veteran, Georg felt more than capable of handling any ensuing conflict. The following days were uneventful. Then a storm rolled in on the night of May 5.
