The person sitting was the body of the man who'd been buried there. He had been decapitated, and his head was missing. Months later, on November 6th, a man was visiting a cemetery in Foyt to pay his respects to a deceased relative. While walking through the grounds, he spotted a grave that had been dug up. The coffin within had been prized open, and the naked body of a young girl was sitting upright on the mound of dirt. When Vestfriedorf mortuary night watchman Georg Varmut came across the intruder kissing
坐在那里的是埋葬在那里的男人的尸体。他被斩首了，头部不见了。几个月后的11月6日，一名男子正在参观福伊特（Foyt）的一处公墓，以悼念一位已故的亲属。在墓地里漫步时，他发现了一个被盗掘的坟墓。里面的棺材被撬开，一个年轻女孩赤裸的尸体正端坐在土堆上。当韦斯特弗里德霍夫（Vestfriedorf）停尸房夜间看守格奥尔格·瓦尔穆特撞见闯入者亲吻

