the corpse, he immediately leapt into action. The perpetrator, realizing he'd been caught in the act, made a break for the exit. Georg chased after him, grabbing him by the collar as he reached the door. He pulled the man into a nearby elevator where the diffused light illuminated the man's face. He was a strange-looking individual aged in his 30s with spectacles and a bulbous nose. He didn't utter a word. A loud bang interrupted the pair's altercation as Georg was hit by a painful blow.
尸体时，他立即采取了行动。肇事者意识到自己被当场抓获，便夺路而逃。格奥尔格紧追不舍，在嫌疑人到达门口时抓住了他的领子。他把这名男子拉进附近的一部电梯里，柔和的光线照亮了这名男子的脸。这是一个长相怪异的30多岁男子，戴着眼镜，有着一个硕大的鼻子。他一言不发。一声巨响打断了两人的争吵，格奥尔格受到沉重的一击。

