Blood seeped from his upper abdomen into his shirt. He let go of the intruder, who was holding a smoking 7.65mm pistol, and fell to the ground. The gunman grinned at the wounded Georg before taking off. Georg crawled on all fours to the telephone in his office. He called emergency services, then dragged himself to the bathroom to tend to his injury. The bullet had damaged his small and large intestines as well as his bladder. But Georg survived. Police arrived and sealed off the mortuary, but the gunman was long gone.
鲜血从他的上腹部渗入衬衫。他松开了拿着一支冒烟的7.65毫米手枪的闯入者，倒在地上。持枪者对受伤的格奥尔格咧嘴一笑，然后逃跑了。格奥尔格手脚并用地爬到办公室的电话机旁。他拨打了急救电话，然后把自己拖到浴室去处理伤口。子弹损伤了他的小肠、大肠以及膀胱。但格奥尔格活了下来。警察赶到并封锁了停尸房，但枪手早已逃之夭夭。

