Georg was able to provide a detailed description of his assailant. By the following day, 50 detectives were chasing up the alibis of known gravediggers, robbers, thieves and other criminals in the area. All of them were accounted for. When 24-year-old Marcus Adler met 19-year-old Ruth Lissy, it was love at first sight. The pair met three years earlier in Yugoslavia and had been inseparable since. Marcus and his mother ran a freight business in Ulberhausen, while Ruth was employed as a salesperson more than 470km away in Nuremberg.
格奥尔格能够提供袭击者的详细体貌特征。到第二天，50名侦探正在追查当地已知的掘墓人、强盗、小偷和其他罪犯的不在场证明。所有这些人都排除了嫌疑。当24岁的马库斯·阿德勒（Marcus Adler）遇到19岁的露丝·利西（Ruth Lissy）时，那是真正的日久生情。两人三年前在南斯拉夫相遇，此后形影不离。马库斯和他的母亲在乌尔伯豪森（Ulberhausen）经营一家货运公司，而露丝则在470多公里外的纽伦堡担任销售员。

14
00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:52.000
Every chance that he got, Marcus drove the long journey in his light grey Mercedes to visit Ruth. On May 6, Marcus set out for the home where Ruth lived with her parents. After he arrived, the two decided to go for a drive together. They farewelled Ruth's mother at 6pm and left in Marcus's car. The young couple headed to a forest east of Nuremberg, a short drive from Ruth's home. After finding a scenic spot to park, the two dozed off, with Marcus in the front seat and Ruth lying in the back.
马库斯抓住每一个机会，开着他的浅灰色梅赛德斯汽车进行长途旅行去探望露丝。5月6日，马库斯动身前往露丝与父母同住的家。他到达后，两人决定一起开车兜风。他们在下午6点向露丝的母亲告别，坐着马库斯的车离开。这对年轻情侣前往纽伦堡以东的一片森林，距离露丝的家只有短途车程。找到一个风景优美的停车地点后，两人打起盹来，马库斯在前排座位上，露丝躺在后座。

15
00:09:52.000 --> 00:10:36.000
Nearby, a short, bespectacled man drove through the forest on his red moped. It was the perfect place for him to lay low until the heat of the vest-free-dough mortuary shooting dissipated. He had spent the day exploring the wilderness where he carried out target practice. This particular forest was popular with hunters, so the sound of his shooting at traffic signs, trees and the occasional deer didn't attract any unwanted attention. The man was still there at dusk, riding around aimlessly when he spotted the light grey Mercedes with the sleeping couple inside.
附近，一个身材矮小、戴着眼镜的男子骑着他的红色轻便摩托车穿过森林。对他来说，这是潜伏起来直到西弗里德霍夫停尸房枪击案的风头过去的最完美地方。他花了一天时间探索荒野，并在那里进行打靶练习。这片特殊的森林深受猎人喜爱，因此他向路标、树木和偶尔出现的鹿开枪的声音并没有引起任何不必要的注意。黄昏时分，这名男子仍然在那里漫无目的地骑着车，这时他发现了停着那辆载着睡觉情侣的浅灰色梅赛德斯。

