sucking the blood from them. Once he'd had enough, he clambered into the backseat. He tore Ruth's sweater off, pushed up her bra, then licked the blood from her chest wound. After 10 minutes, he was overcome with a calming sense of satisfaction. He felt stronger than before. The man pulled off Ruth's engagement ring and rummaged through her purse. He found Marcus' wallet in the glove compartment. As he examined its contents, he noticed someone approaching the car.
吮吸着他们的血。吸够之后，他爬进了后座。他扯下露丝的毛衣，推起她的胸罩，然后舔舐她胸口伤口上的血。10分钟后，他被一种平静的满足感所淹没。他觉得自己比以前更强壮了。这名男子扯下露丝的订婚戒指，并在她的钱包里翻找起来。他在手套箱里找到了马库斯的钱包。当他检查里面的东西时，他注意到有人正朝车子走来。

