A hunter was combing the edge of the forest when he spotted the light grey Mercedes parked up ahead. The hunter was standing nearby, acting nervously. It was a small man wearing a leather hat and sunglasses. He then rushed to a red moped parked five metres away and sped off. The hunter reached the Mercedes and peered through its windows, finding the bodies of Marcus Adler and Ruth Lissie inside. Shocked by the grisly discovery, the hunter fired his shotgun into the air to alert nearby
一名猎人正在梳理森林边缘，这时他发现了前方停着的浅灰色梅赛德斯。猎人站在附近，表现得很紧张。那是一个戴着皮帽和太阳镜的小个子男人。然后他冲向停在五米外的一辆红色轻便摩托车，加速逃走了。猎人走到梅赛德斯车前，透过车窗向内张望，发现里面躺着马库斯·阿德勒和露丝·利西的尸体。对这起可怕的发现感到震惊的猎人向空中开了一枪，以警告附近的

