hikers and farmers that help was needed. There was no response. Left with no other option, he was forced to trek one and a half kilometres to the nearest foam booth, where he contacted police. Post mortems revealed that Marcus and Ruth's wounds had been sucked clean of blood. The double homicide occurred less than 24 hours after the shooting of Georg Varmut and in the same city. Investigators wondered if the two incidents were related.
徒步旅行者和农民需要救援。没有任何回应。别无选择，他被迫长途跋涉一公里半到达最近的泡沫亭，在那里他联系了警察。尸检显示，马库斯和露丝伤口上的血被吮吸得干干净净。这起双重谋杀案发生在枪击格奥尔格·瓦尔穆特后不到24小时，并且在同一个城市。调查人员想知道这两起事件是否有关联。

