00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:59.000
They compared the bullets retrieved from both crime scenes. They were a perfect match. The head of Nuremberg's homicide squad called the disturbed perpetrator a madman. We have to act fast, he asserted, otherwise there will be more deaths. A task force was swiftly formed to hunt down the killer, while a 6,000 Deutsche Mark reward was offered for his capture. His physical description was published in newspapers, along with an alert for the public to be on the lookout for his distinctive red moped.
他们对比了从两个犯罪现场找回的子弹。它们完全吻合。纽伦堡凶杀案调查组的负责人称这个精神错乱的肇事者是个疯子。我们必须采取行动，他断言，否则会有更多人丧生。当局迅速成立了一个特别工作组来追捕凶手，同时悬赏6000德国马克缉拿归案。他的体貌特征被刊登在报纸上，同时向公众发出警报，注意他那辆标志性的红色轻便摩托车。

