00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:44.000
Helmut Kostan was employed with a transit company based in Nuremberg. Four days after the Adler and Lissy slayings, Helmut picked up a copy of a local paper. The blood-sucking, gun-wielding madman terrorizing the city was still making headlines. Helmut was struck by the suspect's description. It reminded him of his colleague, 41-year-old Kuno Hoffman. Hoffman was a short-statured, black-haired man who wore spectacles and drove a red moped. Just a minute earlier, Hoffman had entered the manager's office and abruptly resigned from his job.
赫尔穆特·科斯坦（Helmut Kostan）受雇于纽伦堡的一家运输公司。在阿德勒和利西被害四天后，赫尔穆特拿起了一份当地报纸。这个在城市里恐怖施虐的吸血持枪疯子仍然占据着各大头条。赫尔穆特的注意力被嫌疑人的描述吸引住了。这让他想起了他的同事、41岁的库诺·霍夫曼（Kuno Hoffman）。霍夫曼是一个身材矮小、留着黑发、戴着眼镜并骑着红色轻便摩托车的男人。就在一分钟前，霍夫曼刚走进经理办公室，并突然辞去了工作。

