00:14:44.000 --> 00:15:27.000
He no longer wanted to work the docks loading boxes into trucks, instead expressing a desire to go to Hamburg. Hoffman had just left when Helmut Kostan came across his description in the local paper in relation to the recent killings. Helmut rushed to a phone and called the police. Kuno Hoffman was a troubled individual. Following his birth in 1931, he was violently beaten by his alcoholic father. At age one, Kuno's father shoved him into a sack and threw him away.
他再也不想在码头上干将箱子装上卡车的活了，而是表达了去汉堡的愿望。霍夫曼刚离开，赫尔穆特·科斯坦就在当地报纸上看到了与近期谋杀案有关的他的体貌描述。赫尔穆特冲到电话旁报了警。库诺·霍夫曼是一个饱受心理折磨的人。1931年出生后，他遭到酗酒父亲的暴力殴打。一岁时，库诺的父亲把他塞进麻袋里扔掉了。

